# Do NOT set SANDBOX_LOGIN_SECRET, MOCK_PROVIDER_SECRET, APP_RELEASE_TEST_MODE=1
# or APP_RELEASE_LOCAL_DIR in production. No mock/notification/manual settlement.
# Official callbacks return 503 PROVIDER_NOT_ONBOARDED; dynamic QRIS is unavailable.
